
flowchart TD
    A([User Research Query]) --> B[Coordinator Agent]
    B --> C[Research Agent]
    C --> D[Collect Research Information]
    D --> E[Analyzer Agent]
    E --> F[Analyze Findings and Extract Insights]
    F --> G[Critic Agent]
    G --> H{Content Valid?}
    H -->|No| I[Send Feedback and Corrections]
    I --> C
    H -->|Yes| J[Writer Agent]
    J --> K[Generate Final Research Report]
    K --> L[Coordinator Agent]
    L --> M([Deliver Final Report to User])

    B -.-> N[(Shared State)]
    C -.-> N
    E -.-> N
    G -.-> N
    J -.-> N
